SUMMARY:Summer Season/ Under The Lights Flag Football League
DESCRIPTION:🏈 DAVIS FLAG FOOTBALL SUMMER REGISTRATION IS NOW OPEN! 🌟 \nGet ready for an unforgettable summer with Under The Lights Youth Flag Football in Davis! 🔥 \nBring your energy\, teamwork\, and competitive spirit for a fun-filled season under the lights! \n📍 Location: Community Park Soccer Field 203 E 14th St\, Davis\, CA 95616\n🗓 Sunday Morning Games ⏰ Starting at 9:00 AM \nSeason Dates: ✅ July 12 ✅ July 19 ✅ July 26 ✅ August 2 ✅ August 9 \n👦👧 Boys & Girls Divisions 🏈 6v6 Flag Football 💪 Build confidence 🔥 Improve skills 🤝 Make friends 🎉 Have fun \n🚨 LIMITED TIME SPECIAL 🚨 Sign up with your sibling\, classmate\, or friend and receive: \n💥 50% OFF Registration Fees! 💥\nPlay together\, compete together\, and make unforgettable memories this summer!\nRegister with link below 👇\n📲 UAFLAG.COM/DAVIS
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/summer-season-under-the-lights-flag-football-league/
