SUMMARY:Yoga in the Lavender Fields
DESCRIPTION:🧘‍♀️💜 Yoga in the Lavender Fields 💜🧘‍♂️\n📅 June 6 | 9:30–10:30 AM\nTicket Includes: Yoga Class in the Relaxing Lavender Fields\n🌿 Wine Club Members: Please log in to have your discount automatically applied at checkout.\nStart your Saturday surrounded by the beauty and fragrance of blooming lavender! Join us for a peaceful morning yoga class nestled among the Great Bear lavender fields\, where gentle movement\, fresh air\, and stunning vineyard views come together for the ultimate relaxation experience.\nThis calming practice combines a gentle series of postures with slow\, mindful movement designed to help you reconnect with your breath and body. Flow seamlessly from one pose to the next as you explore the balance between strength and softness\, stretch and stability\, effort and ease.\n✨ Perfect for all experience levels\, this class offers a supportive atmosphere where you can deepen your understanding of alignment\, balance\, and presence while enjoying the soothing sights and scents of lavender in bloom. Create space within your practice\, quiet your mind\, and leave feeling refreshed\, renewed\, and ready for the day ahead.\n🍷 Stretch before you sip! After class\, reward yourself with a glass of wine and enjoy a relaxing morning at the winery.\nBring your mat\, your friends\, and your love of lavender—we’ll take care of the rest!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/yoga-in-the-lavender-fields/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Fitness
