SUMMARY:Lavender Brunch
DESCRIPTION:💜🌿 Lavender Brunch at Great Bear Vineyards 🌿💜\n📅 Saturday\, June 6\, 10:30am\nCelebrate Lavender Weekend with a beautiful morning of delicious food\, blooming lavender\, and vineyard charm!\nBegin your day surrounded by the sights and scents of lavender in full bloom as you enjoy a thoughtfully curated brunch experience at Great Bear Vineyards. Set against the peaceful backdrop of the vineyard\, this catered buffet brunch is the perfect opportunity to slow down\, savor the season\, and gather with friends and family for a relaxing spring morning.\nAs you dine\, take in the calming fragrance of the lavender fields and soak up the beauty of the estate. After brunch\, spend the day exploring all the special activities\, vendors\, and experiences that make our Lavender Weekend celebration so magical.\n✨ What’s in Bloom for You?\n💜 Wander through vibrant lavender fields perfect for dreamy photos\n💐 Pick your own lavender bouquet or take home a freshly harvested bunch\n🍑 Enjoy freshly picked seasonal fruit from our orchard\n🛍️ Taste\, Browse & Shop\n🍯 Sample and purchase local honey from The Hive\n🕯️ Browse handcrafted lavender soaps\, lip balms\, and candles from Capay Valley Lavender Farm\n🌸 Shop stunning floral creations from Zeeba Blooms\n💜 Explore Great Bear’s handmade lavender wreaths\, lavender oil\, apparel\, wine accessories\, and more\n🍽️ Brunch Buffet Includes\n🍓 Seasonal Fresh Fruit Bowl\n🥗 Cranberry Apple Quinoa Salad\n🌿 Mediterranean Orzo Pasta Salad\n🥧 Vegetable Quiche\n🥔 Ham\, Cheese & Potato Quiche\n🍞 French Toast Casserole\n🥓 Bacon\n🥐 Assorted Breakfast Breads & Pastries\n🥂 Optional Additions\n✨ Glass of Sparkling Wine or Mimosa – $12\n🍷 Bottle of Chardonnay\, Rosé\, or Red Blend (The Duet) – $38\n🍾 Bottle of Sparkling Rosé – $57.50\n🌱 Dietary Accommodations\nIf you have dietary restrictions or preferences\, please email us at greatbearvineyards@gmail.com after booking. We will do our best to accommodate:\n• Gluten Free\n• Nut Free\n• Pescatarian\n• Shellfish Free\n• Vegan\n• Vegetarian\n📌 Reservations Required\nAdvance reservations are required to ensure a delightful dining experience.\nGather your favorite people\, breathe in the fragrance of lavender\, enjoy a delicious brunch\, and experience one of the most beautiful weekends of the year at Great Bear Vineyards. We can’t wait to celebrate lavender season with you!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/lavender-brunch/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/6-6-26-Brunch-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
